Package: duckdb
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libc6 (>= 2.25), libstdc++6 (>= 6), libgcc-s1
Description: fast in-process analytical SQL database (CLI)
 DuckDB is a fast, in-process analytical SQL database — "SQLite for
 analytics". It reads and writes CSV, Parquet and JSON directly, speaks
 rich SQL with excellent performance on analytical workloads, and installs
 extensions (httpfs, spatial, ...) at runtime from the official extension
 repository. This package ships the official duckdb CLI.
